.el .ds Aq '
.TH orgsidian-index-stats 1  "stats " 
.SH NAME
orgsidian\-index\-stats \- Print index statistics: counts, schema version, last\-indexed time
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorgsidian index stats\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIVAULT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print index statistics: counts, schema version, last\-indexed time
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit a single JSON object to stdout instead of human\-readable text (no progress lines)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIVAULT\fR>
Path to the vault root directory to index
